  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JxVHUqj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1035\" height=\"690\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong><em>1.1版本重要提醒！此模組需要安裝 Photon 和 Curios 模組&nbsp;</em></strong></strong></span></p><p><strong><em>Photon：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/photon\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/photon</a></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Curios：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios</a></em></strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong><strong><em>必須替換 Photon 模組中的 ldlib2 資料夾，特效才會正常運作！！！</em></strong></strong></span></p><p><strong>&gt; 特效下載：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lf5pJ7HyXx3L8lQEYf1_Y782Q8Y2FQhS/view?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lf5pJ7HyXx3L8lQEYf1_Y782Q8Y2FQhS/view?usp=drive_link</a></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>查看維基指南：</strong></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft-guides.com%252fmod%252fage-of-dragons%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/age-of-dragons/</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#930\"><strong><strong>在 Youtube 上追蹤我以獲取最新更新：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BeyondTheOcean-e1u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@BeyondTheOcean-e1u</a></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">龍之紀元</span>是一款黑暗奇幻 RPG </strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>模組，靈感來自魂系遊戲。它透過擴展遊戲中期、後期和終局之後的內容，加入新的機制、</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>進度系統和強大的 Boss 戰，將遊戲轉變為充滿挑戰的全新冒險。從多種職業中選擇，每種職業</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>都提供獨特的技能、能力和遊玩風格。隨著進度解鎖並升級你的能力，讓你自訂角色</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>並精通所選的道路。每個職業都有獨特的機制，</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>鼓勵不同的戰鬥和探索方式。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>透過精心設計的線性進度系統，收集稀有材料、製作</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>強大裝備，並克服越來越困難的挑戰。面對考驗你技巧、</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>耐心和準備的強力 Boss 戰。掌握新的招架和衝刺系統是生存</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>的關鍵，能夠扭轉最艱難的戰局。並揭開龍之紀元</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ADNpz55S678?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 特色：&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 6 種職業</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 超過 100 種新實體</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 超過 20 種龍</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 超過 20 個 Boss 和迷你 Boss</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 超過 200 種方塊與物品</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 36 套新盔甲</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 超過 20 種新武器</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新的製作站</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 1 個新維度</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 18 種獨特符文石&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 重鑄系統</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 還有更多內容等待探索，以及更多</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 未來將會加入的內容</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">職業介面</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6MVp77T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1130\" height=\"636\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">荊棘王國維度</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pdCIgB2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1130\" height=\"594\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eCXKfMj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1130\" height=\"594\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Fznw8ep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1130\" height=\"594\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o9ApmYs.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QsffgXn.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/QsffgXn.png\" width=\"688\" height=\"511\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nV5c7Lv.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/nV5c7Lv.png\" width=\"452\" height=\"424\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pRIIg2g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"442\" height=\"255\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a9qd8DX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"701\" height=\"551\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qAkqIsP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"315\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8xsFuUn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"407\" height=\"417\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CnOeMH6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"253\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>未來更新：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 指南書</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 荊棘王國維度中的新生物群落和 Boss</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 所有稀有龍均可馴服</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 職業晉升</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 更多符文石</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 更多故事元素</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 打磨與錯誤修復</strong></span></p><p